GDS patch
----------
RockyとAlmaは次のpatchを適用してインストールしないとGDSが使えないので注意。行数はDOCAのバージョンによって変わる。
Please note that Rocky and Alma cannot use GDS unless you apply and install the following patch. The number of lines varies depending on the version of DOCA.


```diff
--- doca-kernel-support.org	2025-10-31 10:47:19.009660599 +0000
+++ doca-kernel-support	2025-10-31 10:47:52.804187965 +0000
@@ -416,7 +416,7 @@
 	options="$options --with-iser-mod"
 	options="$options --with-isert-mod"
 	options="$options --with-nfsrdma-mod"
-	case "$DISTRO" in rhel:* | kylin:* | ubuntu:18.04 | ubuntu:2[024].04)
+	case "$DISTRO" in rhel:* | almalinux:* | rocky:* | kylin:* | ubuntu:18.04 | ubuntu:2[024].04)
 		verbose "Kernel build option GDS enabled ($DISTRO)."
 		options="$options --with-gds"
 		;;
```